<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ru">
<head><%- include('partials/subscription-head', { title: `Смена пароля — ${appName}` }) %></head>
<body class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-900">
  <main class="flex min-h-screen items-center justify-center px-4 py-8">
    <section class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:p-8">
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-semibold">Смените пароль</h1>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-600">Для продолжения задайте новый пароль длиной не менее 8 символов.</p>
      <% if (error) { %><div role="alert" class="mt-5 rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-red-50 p-4 text-sm text-red-800"><%= error %></div><% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/admin/password" class="mt-6 space-y-5">
        <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold" for="password">Новый пароль</label>
          <input id="password" type="password" name="password" minlength="8" required autocomplete="new-password" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3">
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-semibold" for="password_confirmation">Повторите пароль</label>
          <input id="password_confirmation" type="password" name="password_confirmation" minlength="8" required autocomplete="new-password" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 px-4 py-3">
        </div>
        <button type="submit" class="min-h-[44px] w-full rounded-lg bg-blue-700 px-5 py-3 font-semibold text-white hover:bg-blue-800">Сохранить пароль</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
